# Styling / UI

- Primary UI system: Vuetify 3 via `vuetify-nuxt-module`; theme tokens in `vuetify.config.ts`.
- Prefer Vuetify props + utility classes over custom CSS.
- Club theme/avatar come from club settings (`useState('club')`); layout `in-da-club` restores theme cookie.
- Icons: `@mdi/font` / MDI names already used in templates.
- Rich text: Quill only on club information edit.
- Do not add Tailwind, UnoCSS, or another component library without approval.
